      "content": "i feel like i've tried that though. i've tried talking, i've tried sleeping, i've tried everything. it doesn't change the fact that the engine is just dead. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace, to actually stop this constant noise and heavy feeling, is to just... stop everything. does that even make sense? like, if the battery is gone, you wouldn't keep trying to turn the machine on, right?",
